            <ArticleTitle>Sewing-pin perforation of the appendix into the bladder.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>66-7</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We report a 2.5-year-old child who presented with an acute abdomen caused by the perforation of a sewing pin through her appendix that had started to penetrate the wall of the bladder.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
